      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Let $A$ be a $7\\times 12$ matrix that has $6$ **pivot** columns. What is the rank of the matrix?",
      "worked_solution": "We know that $\\text{rank}(A)$ is the number of pivot columns in $A.$ \n\nSince we are told that $A$ has $6$ pivot columns, we have \n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)=6.\n$$",
